  "description": "Alterations to brick front boundary wall",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed boundary treatment by reason its\r\nexcessive height, extended width along the boundary and the lack of robust soft\r\nlandscaping entwined within the wall, is considered to have a harmful impact on\r\nthe character and setting of the Stanmore Hill Conservation Area. As such, the\r\ndevelopment fails to accord with aspirations of Section 72 of the Planning\r\n(Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990, Policy HC1 of the London\r\nPlan (2021), Policy HE1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) Plan and guidance\r\nin the Stanmore Hill Conservation Area Appraisal and Management Strategy.&lt;/p&gt;"
